<title>GREECE: Alpha Credit Bank to sign $150mln facility- Sanwa.</title>
<headline>Alpha Credit Bank to sign $150mln facility- Sanwa.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Credit Bank, Greece's largest private commercial bank, will sign today a syndicated, multi-currency trade facility equivalent to $150 million, an official at arranger Sanwa Bank told Reuters.</p>
<p>Sanwa, Deutsche, Dresdner and Dia-Ichi-Kangyo Bank are the arrangers, the official said.</p>
<p>An official announcement is expected later on. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
